  "notes": "Widest blast radius in the corpus. Minor-unit money is a cross-cutting semantic convention, not one field: catalog owns it, basket and order compute with it, payment persists and validates it, and the SPA renders it. A name-matcher finds the fields; only semantic tracing prices the breakage."
